WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.130
Lucía writes: Mi hermano tuvo
mucho éxito en el examen.

2
00:00:04.180 --> 00:00:07.470
You've never been taught
this word: éxito.

3
00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:10.470
It looks just like the
English word "exit".

4
00:00:10.520 --> 00:00:13.010
So what happened to her
brother in that exam,

5
00:00:13.060 --> 00:00:15.310
and how can you possibly tell?

6
00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:18.850
In this mission, you'll crack
words that look like English,

7
00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:21.943
using spelling swaps like
the one in la nación.

8
00:00:21.993 --> 00:00:24.930
You'll unlock whole word
families from one root,

9
00:00:24.980 --> 00:00:28.810
and read the prefixes and
suffixes added to a word.

10
00:00:28.860 --> 00:00:33.030
And you'll let the sentence
around a word reveal its job.

11
00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:37.050
Your mission: work out words
nobody ever taught you.
